sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Collection Staff
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant App as Flask App
    participant Authz as Role Authorization
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    S->>UI: Log in (Collection Staff role)
    UI->>App: POST /auth/login
    App->>Authz: Verify role = Staff
    Authz-->>App: Authorized
    App-->>UI: Staff dashboard
    UI->>S: Show assigned tasks

    S->>UI: Open task details
    UI->>App: GET /staff/task/:id
    App->>Authz: Check task.staff_id == current_user.id
    Authz-->>App: Owner authorized
    App->>DB: SELECT Task + Updates (task_id)
    DB-->>App: Task + update history
    App-->>UI: Render task detail
    UI->>S: Display task, status, remarks

    S->>UI: Enter progress status + remarks
    S->>UI: Submit task update
    UI->>App: POST /staff/task/:id/update
    App->>Authz: Check ownership + valid status
    Authz-->>App: Authorized
    App->>DB: INSERT TaskUpdate (task_id, updated_by,<br/>status, remarks)
    App->>DB: UPDATE CollectionTask set task_status,<br/>completed_at if completed
    DB-->>App: Update OK
    App-->>UI: 200 + confirmation
    UI->>S: Display updated task status

    note over UI,DB: Citizen & Admin views reflect<br/>latest status on next load
